    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-d158793809b09579ce54860a",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "频率响应法允许我们考察传递函数 T(jω)，并关注系统的幅值和相角特性。这种利用幅频、相频方程及曲线来研究和表征系统特性的能力，是控制系统分析与设计的一大优势。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The frequency response method allows us to consider the transfer function T(jω) and to concern ourselves with the amplitude and phase characteristics of the system. This ability to investigate and represent the character of a system by amplitude, phase equations, and curves is an advantage for the analysis and design of control systems.",
